    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how can i be a person with \"worth\" when all i do is diminish theirs? everything i touch turns to ash. it feels so selfish to keep dragging them down just because i want to stay. if a branch is truly dying and hurting the rest of the tree, isn't the most honorable thing to just let it fall? to just... step aside so the rest can thrive?",
